    "updated_at": "2022-03-31T18:57:30Z",
    "body": "Oh, huh. I guess we considered that. Indeed I feel like louder failure is probably better. In this case I should delete the extra check from \"show the picker, if applicable\".\r\n\r\nAs for whether it's in the DOM or not, I think in https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/6909#issuecomment-959920817 we considered this and decided it was OK to show pickers for elements not in the DOM, since that generally works for existing elements. (Especially on mobile.)",
