    "body": "Hmm, so `color` and `file` at least in Firefox are special because they use the OS window system and aren't positioned relative to the element. But other elements like date / datetime need an element to get positioned, and would feel a bit weird in the middle of nowhere, IMO, since there would be no OS window toolbar, etc.",
